y where your mental agility will be constantly challenged.&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761130/extras/56e4efdefba20c4ee6fe314a66d7c611.poster.avif?t=1740757010\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761130/extras/56e4efdefba20c4ee6fe314a66d7c611.webm?t=1740757010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761130/extras/56e4efdefba20c4ee6fe314a66d7c611.mp4?t=1740757010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
